{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586450/extras/82a17a3d9e31ac214ef1c2abf5b700de.avif?t=1772419851\" width=780 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memories in a tranquil elven village devoted to worshipping the World Tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the elves living here are women, and they have a unique request\u2014they ask for your help in having children...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace a leisurely slow life filled with relaxation, and enjoy your days freely bonding with the charming and distinctive elven girls!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586450/extras/9e3b1d78ee22bec36738794eba60be52.avif?t=1772419851\" width=780 height=81 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing Slow-Life Activities</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in farming: grow a variety of crops and care for livestock to fully experience ranch life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience seasonal changes in the village: enjoy gathering items, bug-catching, and fishing, along with special seasonal events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop and expand the village as you progress, unlocking new features and expanding your home.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Relationships</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with the elven girls, gift them items, and strengthen your bonds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deepen your connections and unlock marriage possibilities\u2014aim to build your dream harem by marrying every girl!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dress-Up and Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the girls' outfits at any time, customizing colors to your preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a wide range of outfits, including everyday wear, uniforms, and fun cosplay costumes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extra Content and Mini-Games</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in exciting horse races with horses you've personally raised. Train your horse to become a champion in prestigious G1 races!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on diverse challenges to earn trophies, and proudly display your achievements in your trophy room.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this delightful world of relaxation, romance, and endless possibilities!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586450?t=1772419851","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586450?t=1772419851","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586450/06f7b10bcff690a2bb82020712ab740641bb0d47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772419851","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586450/06f7b10bcff690a2bb82020712ab740641bb0d47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772419851","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586450/extras/82a17a3d9e31ac214ef1c2abf5b700de.avif?t=1772419851\" width=780 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memories in a tranquil elven village devoted to worshipping the World Tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the elves living here are women, and they have a unique request\u2014they ask for your help in having children...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace a leisurely slow life filled with relaxation, and enjoy your days freely bonding with the charming and distinctive elven girls!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586450/extras/9e3b1d78ee22bec36738794eba60be52.avif?t=1772419851\" width=780 height=81 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing Slow-Life Activities</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in farming: grow a variety of crops and care for livestock to fully experience ranch life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience seasonal changes in the village: enjoy gathering items, bug-catching, and fishing, along with special seasonal events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop and expand the village as you progress, unlocking new features and expanding your home.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Relationships</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with the elven girls, gift them items, and strengthen your bonds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deepen your connections and unlock marriage possibilities\u2014aim to build your dream harem by marrying every girl!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dress-Up and Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the girls' outfits at any time, customizing colors to your preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a wide range of outfits, including everyday wear, uniforms, and fun cosplay costumes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extra Content and Mini-Games</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in exciting horse races with horses you've personally raised. Train your horse to become a champion in prestigious G1 races!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on diverse challenges to earn trophies, and proudly display your achievements in your trophy room.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this delightful world of relaxation, romance, and endless possibilities!</p>","developers":["Closed Garden"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586450/2c3049f0b41fc80976f4b0278043cfee861c289d/header.jpg?t=1772419851","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3586450/313358600/217bde5e52ffff72f924a4007acaa11994511db2/1764037275/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764039286","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3586450/313358600/217bde5e52ffff72f924a4007acaa11994511db2/1764037275/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764039286","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3586450/313358600/217bde5e52ffff72f924a4007acaa11994511db2/1764037275/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764039286","id":257237413,"name":"en","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257237413/ac6c7fb169faafb63b30314a8c3959180277b32f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764039286"}],"name":"World Tree Ranch: Elven Legacy","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3+ GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3+ GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL ES 2.0 hardware driver support required for WebGL acceleration. (AMD Catalyst 10.9, nVidia 358.50)<br></l